omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oXrUiBdDu_cQ7kNvwHG_wny&_nc_oc=Adq9w8FSb666v7BTQ5exRXZYZe_VtRxnoLuR7Bi9Mjd7SNOxTgU0VyrDzl3s7aYP7RY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOp9vmnyV-8r0AVRh6yeGqR3w_rq1fsWOaFyA85jAmjgA&oe=6ACF9E34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BYeA5_bAVAQQ7kNvwHL2-yV&_nc_oc=AdqrvVdBnAEsqbkgAt9Ds3mxNjyo7PkiylZZXyOi8de9Ows-X4UVzP2aJXMcudCZcxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNACURbEe5b8UYtdbznzwdNXPWcRfgfZbhYQwH2Ex73IA&oe=6ACF9F96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q8GjDgn3hB8Q7kNvwGo3yap&_nc_oc=AdqabvWv7cev8GwPu55ZuaZl68LQWoITTneHTCUJZNW-HaOTho--cJlEnh45raQ5cCQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMIzkkmpkfyAYBPEJj-j3txgYfGflFvV-jK_j_exNTtBA&oe=6ACFB4B7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://